              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweleko ŵajile kutama msinda wine lina lyakwe Nasaleti, pakwanilisya maloŵe giŵaŵecete ŵakulocesya kuti, “Tacikolanjidwa Mnasaleti.”",
